# Service account keys and other secrets.
#
# A Firebase service account key grants FULL admin access to the project and
# bypasses every Firestore and Storage security rule. It is needed only to run
# scripts/sync-claims.mjs (see SECURITY.md). Keep it outside this folder if you
# can; these patterns are the backstop if you don't.
*serviceAccount*.json
*service-account*.json
sa.json
# Firebase names the download <project>-firebase-adminsdk-<hash>.json, so the
# leading wildcard matters — an anchored `firebase-adminsdk-*` would miss it.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*-firebase-*.json
*.pem
*.key

# Local env files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor/OS noise
.DS_Store
*.log
